# Generated at runtime, never source: a plan artifact carries a concrete
# deploy target, live host state, and an expiry. An approval is bound to one
# exact plan and is worthless the moment it leaves the machine that made it.
/ob-plan.json
/ob-approval.json
*.ob-plan.json

