# Documentation site build output and dependencies. The generated reference
# pages under site/src/content/docs/reference/ are NOT ignored: they are
# committed so a reader of the repository sees the same reference a reader of
# the site does, and so `just docs-generate-check` can prove they are current.
/site/node_modules/
/site/dist/
/site/.astro/
